  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NDS - Monitoring System and NDS SDG Investor Map</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project National Development Strategy (NDS) Monitoring and Reporting System and NDS-SDG Investor Map aims to strengthen the capacity of national institutions to carry out, monitor, and report on the National Development Strategy, while also guaranteeing the availability of financial resources for NDS implementation. Its objectives encompass setting up a responsive NDS Monitoring System, creating an interactive NDS Investor Map for the private sector (domestic and foreign), and improving the coordination among stakeholders. Within the overarching framework of NDS implementation, the engagement of a range of donors serves to diversify both resources and expertise. This engagement with diverse donors nurtures a comprehensive approach, tackling various development dimensions and ensuring long-lasting impact. Drawing upon Slovakias experiences, this project will embrace effective models from Slovakias development endeavors, thereby elevating the efficiency and effectiveness of NDS implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
